{
  "file": "module2",
  "page": 50,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.2886962890625,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "The uptake of screening in a risk group (the proportion of those eligible for screening who are actually",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.974370002746582,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.4398803710938,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "screened) can be assessed only if the size of the target group has been well defined. It is normally",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.385986328125,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "possible to obtain the relevant information when screening is conducted within health facilities or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.3970336914062,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "closed settings (such as prisons) and through contact investigations. However, it is often difficult to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.5261840820312,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "obtain this information from outreach screening programmes – for example, when screening is done",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996549606323242,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.3881225585938,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "in the community – although the estimated population size of a targeted community may be used",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        313.32958984375,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "to obtain a rough estimate of the eligible population.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        175.02191162109375,
        418.3969421386719,
        199.81690979003906
      ],
      "text": "4.2 Routines for recording and reporting",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        205.26783752441406,
        527.3761596679688,
        219.71083068847656
      ],
      "text": "In order to obtain the required information for the indicators described above, a TB recording and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        218.4678497314453,
        527.5582885742188,
        232.9108428955078
      ],
      "text": "reporting system needs to include a minimal set of data elements. Although paper-based systems have",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.951543807983398,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        231.6678009033203,
        527.4235229492188,
        246.1107940673828
      ],
      "text": "been used to collect such data, it is now becoming increasingly feasible to collect data electronically,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        244.86781311035156,
        527.6148681640625,
        259.3108215332031
      ],
      "text": "and this should be the standard aspired to for monitoring TB screening activities. The following",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        258.06781005859375,
        309.7090759277344,
        272.5108337402344
      ],
      "text": "strategies can be used to collect the necessary data:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        279.771728515625,
        527.401611328125,
        294.2147521972656
      ],
      "text": "•\t maintain a log of the number of people screened in each risk group. A special register with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        292.9716796875,
        527.4302368164062,
        307.4147033691406
      ],
      "text": "individual-level information for each person screened may be used to obtain more refined data",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        306.17169189453125,
        527.0755615234375,
        320.6147155761719
      ],
      "text": "about subcategories of persons within a risk group. Collecting these data is resource intensive, but",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995599746704102,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        319.3717041015625,
        527.4476318359375,
        333.8147277832031
      ],
      "text": "it may be relevant when a screening programme is started as part of operational research. It may",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        332.57171630859375,
        527.3740844726562,
        347.0147399902344
      ],
      "text": "be feasible to implement this type of data collection on a continual basis for certain risk groups,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        345.7716979980469,
        301.9230041503906,
        360.2147216796875
      ],
      "text": "such as people seeking care in medical facilities;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        358.9717102050781,
        527.3960571289062,
        373.41473388671875
      ],
      "text": "•\t maintain a register of all patients with presumptive TB who undergo further diagnostic evaluation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        372.17169189453125,
        527.4168701171875,
        386.6147155761719
      ],
      "text": "(if a register is used to collect individual-level information for all people who are screened, then",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        385.3717041015625,
        255.79541015625,
        399.8147277832031
      ],
      "text": "this information can be included in it);",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        398.57171630859375,
        527.266845703125,
        413.0147399902344
      ],
      "text": "•\t  include a field in the laboratory register for noting whether the tested patient was identified through",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        411.7716979980469,
        332.3627014160156,
        426.2147216796875
      ],
      "text": "screening and to which risk group the patient belongs;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        424.9717102050781,
        527.4793701171875,
        439.41473388671875
      ],
      "text": "•\t  include a field in the treatment register to note whether the patient was identified through screening",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        438.17169189453125,
        285.48919677734375,
        452.6147155761719
      ],
      "text": "and to which risk group the patient belongs.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        466.60302734375,
        324.6814270019531,
        491.3980407714844
      ],
      "text": "4.3 Programmatic evaluations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        496.8489074707031,
        527.3760375976562,
        511.29193115234375
      ],
      "text": "A successful screening programme may lead to a diminishing yield, at least if the risk group is a fixed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        510.0489501953125,
        527.4486694335938,
        524.491943359375
      ],
      "text": "population. Over time, changes in the background burden of TB, as well as changes in the profile",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        523.2489013671875,
        527.4354248046875,
        537.69189453125
      ],
      "text": "of TB patients in the community (e.g. a trend towards fewer patients with symptomatic TB) can lead",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        536.4489135742188,
        527.4585571289062,
        550.8919067382812
      ],
      "text": "to a reduction in the yield from screening, an increase in the NNS, a reduction in cost–effectiveness",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.64892578125,
        527.6713256835938,
        564.0919189453125
      ],
      "text": "and a change in the ratio of benefits to harms. Trends in all of these indicators need to be monitored,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.998299598693848,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        562.848876953125,
        527.403564453125,
        577.2918701171875
      ],
      "text": "and the prioritization of risk groups, choice of screening approach and screening interval should be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        576.0488891601562,
        527.098388671875,
        590.4918823242188
      ],
      "text": "regularly reassessed. Criteria for stopping screening should be established before a screening initiative",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969256401062012,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        589.2489013671875,
        143.5782012939453,
        603.69189453125
      ],
      "text": "is implemented.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        610.9528198242188,
        527.1943969726562,
        625.3958129882812
      ],
      "text": "Monitoring the indicators discussed above may point to the need for a special assessment, for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        624.15283203125,
        527.4334106445312,
        638.5958251953125
      ],
      "text": "example, to explore the reasons for a low uptake of screening, an unexpectedly low proportion of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        637.352783203125,
        527.4290161132812,
        651.7957763671875
      ],
      "text": "people with presumptive TB that was identified through screening, a low proportion of those with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        650.5529174804688,
        527.3905639648438,
        664.9959106445312
      ],
      "text": "presumptive TB undergoing a diagnostic investigation and a higher than expected NNS. Additional",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        663.7528076171875,
        527.563232421875,
        678.19580078125
      ],
      "text": "quantitative and qualitative analyses may be needed to determine whether there are barriers to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        676.9528198242188,
        415.4070739746094,
        691.3958129882812
      ],
      "text": "screening and to identify opportunities to improve the screening approach.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        796.217041015625,
        136.43409729003906,
        806.7210083007812
      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        796.217041015625,
        170.0604705810547,
        806.7210083007812
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        796.217041015625,
        226.65042114257812,
        806.7210083007812
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.23320007324219,
        801.0170288085938,
        49.47319793701172,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "38",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        805.8170166015625,
        219.03489685058594,
        816.3209838867188
      ],
      "text": "systematic screening for tuberculosis disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}